    "facoltativa": {
      "_doc": "v79.12.1: the named contracts outside art. 5, co. 1 -- their dispute may go to mediation (art. 2 d.lgs. 28/2010), never as a condition of the action: a case whose contract type (the extraction's contract «type») is one of these, and none of the listed matters, prints «Mediazione facoltativa»; the area never makes such a case mandatory (a preliminare di vendita of a house is no «diritti reali» matter), nor a word of its parties or clauses (a «bonifico bancario», a «polizza fideiussoria»). Each entry: the pattern its type matches. «Obbligatoria» is the listed «matters» only. v79.12.1 (review): a named contract outside the list never hides an art. 5 matter the client's own request names -- each area matter's «case.request_words» (the condominio's delibera, the usucapione, the divisione, the lesione della legittima, the errore medico): matched in the extraction's requests (never the contract's type, parties or clauses), it makes the matter «obbligatoria» beside an appalto or a compravendita; a «never» matter (reati, rito del lavoro) prints no mediazione at all, facoltativa neither. A professional's contract (prestazione di servizi professionali, mandato professionale all'avvocato) is a contratto d'opera (art. 2229 c.c.), in the list.",
      "ref": "art. 2 d.lgs. 28/2010",
