    "_doc_v79_18_0": "item 13: fact_signals.mediation reads the matters from this list (no code table): a matter's «case.contracts» / «case.request_words» / «case.words» patterns and «case.areas» find it in the extraction, «word» (default the matter's name) is what finds it in the article's text when the corpus holds art. 5; «appalto» added post-Cartabia beside the contratti d'opera, flagged «da_confermare» for the lawyer."
